# ESLint 8 does not read .gitignore, so without this file `npm run lint`
# walks android/app/build/** (created by any Gradle build, including the
# AC26 debug build this ticket also requires), CTA/** and
# 'Chicago Data Portal/**' (the gitignored raw GIS source folders, which
# are not JS/TS anyway) and fails with hundreds of thousands of
# unrelated problems. Also excludes the generated map-data assets, which
# are produced JSON wrapped in one line of JS (see
# tools/convertMapData.js) - not hand-written source to lint, and large
# enough (~4.3 MB total) that lint ing them would be pure overhead.

android/app/build/
CTA/
Chicago Data Portal/
android/app/src/main/assets/mapdata/
node_modules/
vendor/
